# CHANGES — workbench subtree

Record of modifications to workbench sources and to bundled dependency source.

AGPL-3.0-or-later requires that changes be recorded with dates when covered work is
conveyed. Bundled dependency source is currently **unmodified**.

## 2026-10-23

- Initial workbench subtree created (AGPL-3.0-or-later).
- Bundled dependencies added unmodified: `@strudel/core` 1.2.6, `@strudel/mini` 1.2.6,
  `@strudel/transpiler` 1.2.6, `codemirror` 6.0.2, `@codemirror/state`,
  `@codemirror/lang-javascript`.
- No patch is applied to any dependency at build time; `tools/build-workbench.mjs` only
  bundles and minifies, preserving legal comments at end of file.
